{
  "id": "halo",
  "name": "Halo",
  "for": [
    "webrtc"
  ],
  "note": "White and vertical. Call status, live transcript, Mute and Call.",
  "_comment": [
    "The same tokens and the same panel size as the Webchat + WebRTC Halo \u2014 the",
    "two endpoints are one design, and a voice panel sized differently just",
    "because it holds less would read as a second one.",
    "Declared here AND on :root in templates/webrtc/src/styles.css: the injected",
    "block wins, so both have to move together.",
    "No --webrtc-* block: a non-default theme means Demo Studio draws the voice",
    "UI, so Cognigy's widget container is not on the page to style."
  ],
  "tokens": {
    "--cds-panel-w": "920px",
    "--cds-panel-h": "1800px",
    "--cds-panel-min-h": "470px",
    "--surface": "#ffffff",
    "--surface-raised": "linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff, #fcfdff)",
    "--surface-sunk": "#eef4fc",
    "--surface-inset": "#eff6fd",
    "--footer-bg": "#fcfdff",
    "--ink": "#10223b",
    "--ink-strong": "#0d2139",
    "--ink-soft": "#637e9b",
    "--ink-faint": "#738aa5",
    "--ink-tab": "#193c69",
    "--line": "#e3edf8",
    "--line-soft": "#e0ebf6",
    "--line-field": "#d4e1f0",
    "--line-panel": "#bddbff",
    "--line-tabs": "#bfd9fa",
    "--accent": "#087aff",
    "--accent-2": "#268dff",
    "--accent-grad": "linear-gradient(110deg, #087cff, #268dff)",
    "--bubble-user": "linear-gradient(125deg, #087aff, #0870f5)",
    "--on-accent": "#ffffff",
    "--accent-quiet": "#086bdb",
    "--accent-line": "#1782f7",
    "--live": "#28d999",
    "--dot-idle": "#98b1c9",
    "--danger-grad": "linear-gradient(120deg, #ff646e, #ff5666)",
    "--wave-grad": "linear-gradient(#70b6ff, #087aff)",
    "--r-panel": "27px",
    "--r-bubble": "18px",
    "--r-md": "15px",
    "--r-sm": "14px",
    "--pad-x": "23px",
    "--shadow-panel": "0 0 0 2px #c4ddff66, 0 22px 54px #304d6c1c"
  }
}
